> For the old direct-call system, retain a deliberately separate compatibility entry:
> 
> ```python
> def retrieve_memory_context_legacy(
>     messages: list[dict[str, Any]],
>     context: Any,
>     config: Mapping[str, Any],
> ) -> str:
>     return _build_memory_context(
>         messages,
>         context,
>         str(config.get("strategy", "short_term_only")),
